     CALL "CBL_XOR" USING L-LO L-HI BY VALUE 8
     CALL "XORO-ROTL" USING L-LO WS-N49 WS-ROT
     CALL "CBL_XOR" USING L-HI WS-ROT BY VALUE 8
     CALL STATIC "cc_u64_shl" USING BY REFERENCE L-HI WS-N21 WS-SHIFT
     CALL "CBL_XOR" USING WS-SHIFT WS-ROT BY VALUE 8
     MOVE WS-ROT TO L-LO
