 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. XORO-NEXT-INT.
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 01 WS-LONG                BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
 01 WS-R                   BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
 01 WS-M                   BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
 01 WS-LOW                 BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
 01 WS-THRESHOLD           BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
 01 WS-BOUND               BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
 01 WS-N32                 BINARY-LONG VALUE 32.
 01 WS-TMP                 BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
 LINKAGE SECTION.
 COPY XORO REPLACING LEADING ==XR-== BY ==L-==.
 01 L-BOUND                BINARY-LONG.
 01 L-RESULT               BINARY-LONG.
 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING L-STATE L-BOUND L-RESULT.
     CALL "XORO-NEXT-LONG" USING L-STATE WS-LONG
     MOVE L-BOUND TO WS-BOUND
     PERFORM DRAW-PRODUCT
     IF WS-LOW < L-BOUND
         COMPUTE WS-THRESHOLD = FUNCTION MOD(4294967296 - L-BOUND, L-BOUND)
         PERFORM UNTIL WS-LOW >= WS-THRESHOLD
             CALL "XORO-NEXT-LONG" USING L-STATE WS-LONG
             PERFORM DRAW-PRODUCT
         END-PERFORM
     END-IF
     CALL STATIC "cc_u64_shr" USING BY REFERENCE WS-M WS-N32 WS-TMP
     MOVE WS-TMP TO L-RESULT
     GOBACK.

*> r = the low 32 bits of the long, m = r * bound (below 2^63), low = the low 32 bits of m.
 DRAW-PRODUCT.
     CALL STATIC "cc_u64_shl" USING BY REFERENCE WS-LONG WS-N32 WS-TMP
     CALL STATIC "cc_u64_shr" USING BY REFERENCE WS-TMP WS-N32 WS-R
     CALL STATIC "cc_u64_mul" USING BY REFERENCE WS-R WS-BOUND WS-M
     CALL STATIC "cc_u64_shl" USING BY REFERENCE WS-M WS-N32 WS-TMP
     CALL STATIC "cc_u64_shr" USING BY REFERENCE WS-TMP WS-N32 WS-LOW.
 END PROGRAM XORO-NEXT-INT.

