 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. XORO-GET-SEED.
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 01 WS-M64                 PIC 9(20) VALUE 18446744073709551616.
 01 WS-M32                 BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED VALUE 4294967296.
 01 WS-H63                 BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED VALUE 9223372036854775808.
 01 WS-A                   BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
 01 WS-B                   BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
 01 WS-L                   BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
 01 WS-S                   BINARY-DOUBLE.
 01 WS-T                   BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
 LINKAGE SECTION.
 01 L-X                    BINARY-LONG.
 01 L-Y                    BINARY-LONG.
 01 L-Z                    BINARY-LONG.
 01 L-RESULT               BINARY-DOUBLE.
 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING L-X L-Y L-Z L-RESULT.
*>   (int)(x * 3129871), sign extended to 64 bits, as two's complement bits
     COMPUTE WS-A = FUNCTION MOD(L-X * 3129871, WS-M32)
     IF WS-A >= 2147483648
         COMPUTE WS-A = WS-A + WS-M64 - WS-M32
     END-IF
     COMPUTE WS-B = FUNCTION MOD(L-Z * 116129781, WS-M64)
     COMPUTE WS-L = FUNCTION MOD(L-Y, WS-M64)
     CALL "CBL_XOR" USING WS-A WS-B BY VALUE 8
     CALL "CBL_XOR" USING WS-B WS-L BY VALUE 8
*>   l = l * l * 42317861 + l * 11 (signed 64-bit wrapping)
     IF WS-L >= WS-H63
         COMPUTE WS-S = WS-L - WS-M64
     ELSE
         MOVE WS-L TO WS-S
     END-IF
     COMPUTE WS-T = FUNCTION MOD(WS-S * WS-S * 42317861 + WS-S * 11, WS-M64)
     IF WS-T >= WS-H63
         COMPUTE WS-S = WS-T - WS-M64
     ELSE
         MOVE WS-T TO WS-S
     END-IF
     COMPUTE L-RESULT = FUNCTION INTEGER(WS-S / 65536)
     GOBACK.
 END PROGRAM XORO-GET-SEED.

 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. XORO-AT.
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 01 WS-M64                 PIC 9(20) VALUE 18446744073709551616.
