 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING L-FACTORY L-X L-Y L-Z R-STATE.
     CALL "XORO-GET-SEED" USING L-X L-Y L-Z WS-SEED
     COMPUTE WS-BITS = FUNCTION MOD(WS-SEED, WS-M64)
     CALL "CBL_XOR" USING L-LO WS-BITS BY VALUE 8
     MOVE WS-BITS TO R-LO
     MOVE L-HI TO R-HI
     GOBACK.
 END PROGRAM XORO-AT.

 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. XORO-FROM-HASH.
*> The MD5 digest is read as two big-endian 64-bit words: a word is built byte by byte.
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 01 WS-M64                 PIC 9(20) VALUE 18446744073709551616.
 01 WS-DIGEST              PIC X(64).
 01 WS-DIGEST-LENGTH       BINARY-LONG UNSIGNED.
 01 WS-DATA-LENGTH         BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
 01 WS-ALGORITHM           USAGE POINTER.
 01 WS-ENGINE              USAGE POINTER VALUE NULL.
 01 WS-RC                  BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-I                   BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-BYTE                BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-A                   BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
 01 WS-B                   BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
 LINKAGE SECTION.
 COPY XORO REPLACING ==XR-STATE== BY ==L-FACTORY== LEADING ==XR-== BY ==L-==.
 01 L-NAME                 PIC X(64).
 01 L-LENGTH               BINARY-LONG.
 COPY XORO REPLACING ==XR-STATE== BY ==R-STATE== LEADING ==XR-== BY ==R-==.
 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING L-FACTORY L-NAME L-LENGTH R-STATE.
     MOVE L-LENGTH TO WS-DATA-LENGTH
     CALL STATIC "EVP_md5" RETURNING WS-ALGORITHM
     CALL STATIC "EVP_Digest" USING BY REFERENCE L-NAME BY VALUE WS-DATA-LENGTH
         BY REFERENCE WS-DIGEST BY REFERENCE WS-DIGEST-LENGTH BY VALUE WS-ALGORITHM
         BY VALUE WS-ENGINE RETURNING WS-RC
     MOVE 0 TO WS-A WS-B
     PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-I > 8
         COMPUTE WS-BYTE = FUNCTION ORD(WS-DIGEST(WS-I:1)) - 1
         COMPUTE WS-A = WS-A * 256 + WS-BYTE
         COMPUTE WS-BYTE = FUNCTION ORD(WS-DIGEST(WS-I + 8:1)) - 1
         COMPUTE WS-B = WS-B * 256 + WS-BYTE
     END-PERFORM
     CALL "CBL_XOR" USING L-LO WS-A BY VALUE 8
     CALL "CBL_XOR" USING L-HI WS-B BY VALUE 8
     MOVE WS-A TO R-LO
     MOVE WS-B TO R-HI
     GOBACK.
 END PROGRAM XORO-FROM-HASH.
